        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: GamePro, International Data Group\n- Organizations: DC Comics\n- Products: GamePro magazine, Rush City Zero issue web-comic\n- Topics: video game industry, video game hardware, video game software\n\nFacts:\n- GamePro was an American multiplatform video game magazine media company that published online and print content about the video game industry, video game hardware, and video game software.\n- International Data Group, Inc. is a Chinese-owned, American-based media, data and marketing services, and venture capital organization.\n- In August 2006, DC Comics packaged a special Rush City Zero issue web-comic with the August 2006 issue of GamePro magazine.\n- DC Comics made the special Rush City Zero issue web-comic available on the DC Comics website.",
